<p>Ask anyone who has lived in the Rio Grande Valley (RGV) for a while and they will tell you spring storms can turn ugly fast. But when exactly is hail season in McAllen, and how often does truly damaging hail fall? Rather than rely on memory, we looked at the official record: the NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information (NCEI) Storm Events Database for Hidalgo County, covering hail reports from 1956 through 2025.</p>

