<p>Hail reports are measured in inches of diameter. The NOAA Storm Prediction Center publishes a <a href="https://www.spc.noaa.gov/misc/tables/hailsize.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">standard conversion table</a> that relates common objects to hail sizes. Here are the references you will see most often in reports, with the Hidalgo County counts for each threshold:</p>

<table>
